add(11,'온도표의 (x,y)는m, T는°C. 필요한 값은 T(4,4)=72,T(8,4)=86,T(6,2)=87,T(6,6)=75,T(4,2)=74,T(4,6)=68,T(8,2)=90,T(8,6)=80이다. (a) Tx,Ty(6,4)와단위 (b) u=(1,1)/√2 방향미분·해석 (c) Txy를 추정하라.','For temperature data with coordinates in metres and T in°C, T(4,4)=72,T(8,4)=86,T(6,2)=87,T(6,6)=75,T(4,2)=74,T(4,6)=68,T(8,2)=90,T(8,6)=80. Estimate (a) Tx,Ty at(6,4) and units, (b) the derivative for u=(1,1)/√2 and interpret it, (c) Txy.',['(a) 중앙차분 Tx≈(86−72)/4=3.5, Ty≈(75−87)/4=−3°C/m.','(b) 방향미분≈(3.5−3)/√2=1/(2√2)°C/m, 대각선 방향 이동거리당 온도가 증가한다.','(c) 사각 중앙 혼합차분 [80−90−68+74]/16=−1/4°C/m².'],['(a) Centered differences give Tx≈3.5 and Ty≈−3°C/m.','(b) The directional derivative is(3.5−3)/√2=1/(2√2)°C/m, an increase per diagonal travel distance.','(c) The centered mixed difference is[80−90−68+74]/16=−1/4°C/m².'],'(a)3.5,−3°C/m. (b)1/(2√2)°C/m. (c)−0.25°C/m².','(a)3.5,−3°C/m. (b)1/(2√2)°C/m. (c)−0.25°C/m².',parts=['a','b','c'])
